Feature: Petstore API CRUD Operations\n\n  Scenario: Create a new pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet\"\n    When I send a POST request with the payload\n    Then I should receive a 200 OK response\n    And the response should contain the created pet details\n\n  Scenario: Retrieve an existing pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet/{petId}\"\n    When I send a GET request for pet with ID \"12345\"\n    Then I should receive a 200 OK response\n    And the response should contain the pet details\n\n  Scenario: Update an existing pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet\"\n    When I send a PUT request with the updated payload\n    Then I should receive a 200 OK response\n    And the response should contain the updated pet details\n\n  Scenario: Delete an existing pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet/{petId}\"\n    When I send a DELETE request for pet with ID \"12345\"\n    Then I should receive a 200 OK response\n    And the pet should be deleted